{"id":"sh/e1oz61c3","kind":"textbox","name":"文本框 3","position":{"left":902.63,"top":412.68,"width":373.47,"height":224.93},"text":"SFP+ interface is driven directly by GTX, can be programmed by users to support various communication protocols. This high degree of programmability ensures maximum compatibility with both existing and future communication devices, thereby reducing the cost of device deployment and iterative updates.\nRaw data storage requires a significant amount of storage bandwidth. The limitations of current storage devices necessitate the need to build disk arrays that can support high-bandwidth data storage. ","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
